T*
(authorisation URL with cryptographically strong `state` and `nonce` parameters.) Tj
T*
(• Handles the callback \(`oauth/google_callback.php`\) by validating the `state`,) Tj
T*
(exchanging the authorisation code for tokens via cURL, verifying the ID token) Tj
T*
(signature and claims, and provisioning or linking local accounts.) Tj
T*
(• Integrates with the existing session management and CSRF framework to ensure a) Tj
T*
(consistent security posture.) Tj
T*
T*
(6. Residual Risks and Deferred Items) Tj
T*
(• **Transport security:** Enforcing HTTPS and HSTS requires web server configuration) Tj
T*
(that is outside the application repository. Deployment guides should mandate TLS.) Tj
T*
(• **Rate limiting:** Brute-force protection for login and OAuth callbacks was not) Tj
T*
(implemented due to time constraints. Future iterations should add IP-based) Tj
T*
(throttling or CAPTCHA challenges.) Tj
T*
(• **Comprehensive logging:** The remediation focused on security-critical) Tj
T*
(functionality; centralised auditing and monitoring were not added but remain a) Tj
T*
(recommended control.) Tj
T*
T*
(7. Best Practice Recommendations) Tj
T*
(• Incorporate secure code review and threat modelling into every release cycle.) Tj
T*
(• Store secrets outside source control \(environment variables or secret managers\)) Tj
T*
(and rotate them regularly.) Tj
T*
(• Enforce automated static analysis \(e.g., PHPStan, Psalm\) and dependency scanning) Tj
T*
(in CI pipelines.) Tj
T*
(• Adopt a defence-in-depth mindset: layered controls \(input validation, output) Tj
T*
(encoding, authorisation, logging\) help contain the impact of any single flaw.) Tj
T*
(• Keep third-party SDKs and libraries updated, and monitor for advisories affecting) Tj
T*
(OAuth integrations.) Tj
T*
T*
(8. Testing Evidence) Tj
T*
(• PHP syntax checks were executed for all modified PHP files using `php -l`.) Tj
T*
(• Manual regression testing confirmed that login, registration, booking, admin) Tj
T*
(workflows, and Google OAuth login operate as expected with the new security) Tj
T*
(controls.) Tj
T*
T*
